<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:19.300" end="00:00:24.300" style="s2">Take off that gown, Tolani.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.500" end="00:00:27.800" style="s2">You are not graduating today.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.300" end="00:00:29.400" style="s2">You are going home with your husband.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.800" end="00:00:31.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Jide,</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.400" end="00:00:34.400" style="s2">what husband? They told us the best</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.100" end="00:00:34.400" style="s2">students walk in first.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:40.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.900" end="00:00:43.000" style="s2">I am your late father&#39;s brother.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.400" end="00:00:46.400" style="s2">I have fed you for seven years, and</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.000" end="00:00:46.400" style="s2">today you pay me back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.000" end="00:00:53.300" style="s2">This man works for the company I owe.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.200" end="00:00:56.600" style="s2">From today, you belong to his house, and</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.300" end="00:00:59.700" style="s2">my file stays quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.600" end="00:01:02.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, they call my name in one hour.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.700" end="00:01:05.400" style="s2">Let me hold my certificate first,</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.100" end="00:01:05.400" style="s2">then shout at me at home.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.600" end="00:01:11.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget your certificate. A certificate</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.000" end="00:01:13.300" style="s2">has never paid one naira of my debt.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.300" end="00:01:15.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Papa said nobody can repossess what you</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.300" end="00:01:16.900" style="s2">learned.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.100" end="00:01:19.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your papa is not the one those lenders</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.900" end="00:01:19.400" style="s2">are calling.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.400" end="00:01:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it off. A gown does not wash</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.500" end="00:01:29.000" style="s2">plates.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.600" end="00:01:39.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, please. She is the best in our set.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.200" end="00:01:42.300" style="s2">Let her walk first.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.000" end="00:01:42.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let her walk to the car.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.900" end="00:01:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody drags her, sir. She walks.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.692" end="00:02:12.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your things, we packed them this morning</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.692" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">before you even ironed that gown</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.692" end="00:02:15.592" style="s2">this morning</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.892" end="00:02:18.092" style="s2">until you sat at breakfast and prayed</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.592" end="00:02:20.392" style="s2">over my results.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.092" end="00:02:22.192" style="s2">And God answered you are finished with</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.392" end="00:02:24.192" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.192" end="00:02:27.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From today you tell your people that my</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.192" end="00:02:30.192" style="s2">file is quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.092" end="00:02:30.192" style="s2">Your file will wait, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.192" end="00:02:40.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard all of it, so let me say it</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.892" end="00:02:43.092" style="s2">plainly. My uncle is my late father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.492" end="00:02:43.092" style="s2">younger brother.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.092" end="00:02:50.992" style="s2">He raised me for seven years and he just</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:52.892" style="s2">gave me a way on the road beside my own</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.992" end="00:02:54.992" style="s2">graduation.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.892" end="00:02:57.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody can give you a way.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.992" end="00:03:00.292" style="s2">You are not one of his cars.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.792" end="00:03:01.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what am I standing here for?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.292" end="00:03:03.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.692" end="00:03:05.592" style="s2">I have one errand inside the hall.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.992" end="00:03:06.892" style="s2">When I come back, you choose where you</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.592" end="00:03:10.192" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.892" end="00:03:10.192" style="s2">Not me and not him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.592" end="00:03:35.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, they have called you twice. The</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.192" end="00:03:39.292" style="s2">Vice Chancellor is sweating.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.792" end="00:03:41.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then straighten my tie quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.292" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please rise for our guest of honor,</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.692" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">an old student of this faculty, Ademola.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.392" end="00:03:54.992" style="s2">And now the Ademola prize for the best</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.192" end="00:03:58.292" style="s2">graduating student in accounting,</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.992" end="00:03:58.292" style="s2">Tolani Bakare.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.992" end="00:04:04.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vice Chancellor, she was here at 8:00.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.394" end="00:04:08.494" style="s2">This year she wrote auditing with a</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.694" end="00:04:08.494" style="s2">fever and she still came first.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.894" end="00:04:14.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is not absent, sir. She was taken</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.094" end="00:04:14.694" style="s2">out of that line before you called her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.294" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">Give her certificate and her prize to</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.294" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">me. I will put them in her hand myself.</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.994" end="00:04:29.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, her uncle phoned the registry</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.794" end="00:04:32.794" style="s2">yesterday. He asked us to release her</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.694" end="00:04:35.294" style="s2">certificate to him, not to her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.794" end="00:04:35.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And did you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.494" end="00:04:39.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not while I hold the keys to that</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.094" end="00:04:39.994" style="s2">registry, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.594" end="00:04:50.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the man who owes us 60 million</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.694" end="00:04:50.294" style="s2">naira just gave you his niece.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.194" end="00:04:57.894" style="s2">And he was in a hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.094" end="00:04:57.894" style="s2">Men in a hurry are hiding something.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.394" end="00:05:09.294" style="s2">You did not run.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.294" end="00:05:11.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run where? He changed the locks this</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.294" end="00:05:14.594" style="s2">morning. I have 4,000 naira and a gown I</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.594" end="00:05:14.594" style="s2">still have to return.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.794" end="00:05:23.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take this for a hotel tonight. Only</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.994" end="00:05:23.494" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.194" end="00:05:29.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I will not eat a dead food. Whatever</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.794" end="00:05:32.194" style="s2">my uncle owes your company, I will pay</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.294" end="00:05:32.194" style="s2">it with my own hands.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.794" end="00:05:38.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You owe nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.494" end="00:05:38.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you take me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.894" end="00:05:44.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because if I said no,</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.094" end="00:05:47.194" style="s2">he would have offered you to the next</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.494" end="00:05:47.194" style="s2">man with a file.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.394" end="00:05:53.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did they call my name?</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.094" end="00:05:53.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They called it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.094" end="00:05:57.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And nobody stood up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.694" end="00:06:04.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman I work for has a guest room</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.094" end="00:06:08.295" style="s2">and her cook left last week.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.794" end="00:06:08.295" style="s2">Work for your bed if you like.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.095" end="00:06:14.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work I can do.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.995" end="00:06:17.795" style="s2">Seven years of work I have already done.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.995" end="00:06:17.795" style="s2">Show me the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.195" end="00:06:31.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ocon, you are head of credit in that</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.095" end="00:06:35.695" style="s2">company. Tell me what my file says.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.495" end="00:06:37.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It says 60 million naira, Mr. Bakare.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.695" end="00:06:39.495" style="s2">The final date is Friday, the 31st of</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.895" end="00:06:41.295" style="s2">October.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.495" end="00:06:43.895" style="s2">After that, they take this house and</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.295" end="00:06:47.995" style="s2">every car in your yard.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.895" end="00:06:47.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband, tell him about the buyer.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.095" end="00:06:52.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alhaji pays 150 million at the key</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.795" end="00:06:56.095" style="s2">handover.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.995" end="00:06:58.395" style="s2">Saturday, the 25th, 4:00 in my brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.095" end="00:06:59.995" style="s2">house in Ikoyi.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.395" end="00:07:01.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your brother&#39;s will gives that house to</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.995" end="00:07:05.595" style="s2">the girl the day she puts her degree</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.795" end="00:07:05.595" style="s2">certificate in his barrister&#39;s hand.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.695" end="00:07:12.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The barrister will ask for the heir&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.495" end="00:07:12.095" style="s2">consent.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.495" end="00:07:22.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the paper tells him the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.895" end="00:07:25.695" style="s2">She signed it in front of me in Abuja</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.295" end="00:07:25.695" style="s2">on the 14th of March.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.995" end="00:07:34.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That girl was in Lagos that whole week</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.395" end="00:07:34.095" style="s2">coughing over one of her exams.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.895" end="00:07:40.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I signed her name myself and a notary in</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.895" end="00:07:42.495" style="s2">Abuja stamped it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.195" end="00:07:43.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And her certificate?</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.495" end="00:07:47.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without it,</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.895" end="00:07:49.895" style="s2">the barrister cannot hand her one brick.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.695" end="00:07:51.495" style="s2">And a clerk&#39;s wife has no time for</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.895" end="00:07:53.695" style="s2">lawyers.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.495" end="00:07:57.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And my 20?</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.695" end="00:07:57.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the keys change hands.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.095" end="00:08:06.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then on Saturday, we throw a party in</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.095" end="00:08:08.397" style="s2">that house so all Lagos sees it was to</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.097" end="00:08:08.397" style="s2">sell.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.697" end="00:08:32.497" style="s2">So this is the girl. Clerk, how much</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.497" end="00:08:36.097" style="s2">does that company pay you that you bring</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.497" end="00:08:36.097" style="s2">a wife home with one bag?</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.997" end="00:08:43.297" style="s2">I will report them to the chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.597" end="00:08:46.097" style="s2">Good evening, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.297" end="00:08:48.497" style="s2">You live in a house like this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.097" end="00:08:51.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I keep madam&#39;s books in the evenings.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.497" end="00:08:51.597" style="s2">She keeps a roof over me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.497" end="00:08:57.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, I am not his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.097" end="00:09:00.397" style="s2">My uncle gave me to him this morning</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.697" end="00:09:00.397" style="s2">for a debt.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.397" end="00:09:05.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gave you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.597" end="00:09:07.297" style="s2">Like a goat at a naming ceremony?</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.497" end="00:09:10.097" style="s2">Hear me, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.297" end="00:09:12.197" style="s2">Nobody is given in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:13.897" style="s2">You sleep in the blue guest room inside</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.197" end="00:09:17.297" style="s2">the main house.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.897" end="00:09:19.197" style="s2">Clerk sleeps in the boys&#39; quarters.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.297" end="00:09:20.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chuks.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.197" end="00:09:23.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chuks drives for me. He will carry your</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.997" end="00:09:23.997" style="s2">bag upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.497" end="00:09:32.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, I cannot take a room for nothing. He</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.097" end="00:09:35.697" style="s2">says your cook left. Let me cook.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.997" end="00:09:38.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you make ofada sauce?</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.697" end="00:09:42.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With my eyes closed, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.297" end="00:09:42.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open them. My pepper is expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.597" end="00:09:52.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boys&#39; quarters, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.297" end="00:09:52.297" style="s2">Welcome to my life.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.397" end="00:10:02.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now tell your mother why the chairman of</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.397" end="00:10:04.497" style="s2">Ademola Capital came home through my</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.097" end="00:10:04.497" style="s2">kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.497" end="00:10:09.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four months ago, my father died</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.397" end="00:10:13.598" style="s2">and And his chair.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.498" end="00:10:15.898" style="s2">In our books, loan after loan is marked</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.598" end="00:10:17.698" style="s2">settled, and not one kobo of it ever</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.898" end="00:10:19.898" style="s2">reached our accounts.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.698" end="00:10:22.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Settled by whom?</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.898" end="00:10:23.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Approved by one man, Okon, our head of</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.598" end="00:10:25.298" style="s2">credit.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.698" end="00:10:28.498" style="s2">So for six weeks I have sat in his</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.298" end="00:10:28.498" style="s2">department as a clerk.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.898" end="00:10:33.598" style="s2">Yesterday Jide Bakare came to my desk</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.798" end="00:10:33.598" style="s2">begging for time.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.698" end="00:10:39.398" style="s2">Okon&#39;s note on his file says</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.098" end="00:10:42.398" style="s2">to settle by sale of family house, heirs</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.398" end="00:10:42.398" style="s2">consent attached.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.798" end="00:10:56.798" style="s2">Read it, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.098" end="00:10:58.498" style="s2">Signed in Abuja the 14th of March at 11</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.798" end="00:11:00.898" style="s2">in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.498" end="00:11:04.698" style="s2">A final year student in Lagos signing in</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.898" end="00:11:04.698" style="s2">Abuja on a weekday in exam season.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.698" end="00:11:11.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, with respect, you told a debtor to</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.198" end="00:11:11.798" style="s2">bring his niece to your own speech?</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.298" end="00:11:17.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He chose the place.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.398" end="00:11:21.298" style="s2">He wanted her gone before her name was</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.398" end="00:11:21.298" style="s2">called, and I want to know why.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.398" end="00:11:27.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell her who you are tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.298" end="00:11:29.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With what?</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.598" end="00:11:31.898" style="s2">A copy proves nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.298" end="00:11:33.798" style="s2">The original sits in Okon&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.898" end="00:11:35.598" style="s2">If he hears the chairman is near that</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.798" end="00:11:38.498" style="s2">file,</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.598" end="00:11:38.498" style="s2">the paper burns.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.898" end="00:11:42.498" style="s2">Tomorrow she goes back for her things.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.098" end="00:11:46.798" style="s2">If she knows,</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.498" end="00:11:48.498" style="s2">her face will tell them.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.798" end="00:11:50.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then hear my condition. Wear your</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.498" end="00:11:52.898" style="s2">clerk&#39;s shirt until you hold that paper,</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.798" end="00:11:56.998" style="s2">not one day longer.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.898" end="00:11:56.998" style="s2">And whatever is hers, you give back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.699" end="00:12:20.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The debt is paid, my dear. Receipts do</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.899" end="00:12:22.299" style="s2">not come back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.099" end="00:12:24.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, I came for my books. Only my</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.299" end="00:12:27.199" style="s2">books.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.099" end="00:12:27.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then pick them from the gutter.</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.699" end="00:12:41.699" style="s2">That is my mother&#39;s face.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.499" end="00:12:44.399" style="s2">Seven years in my kitchen and you live</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.699" end="00:12:46.899" style="s2">with less than you came with.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.399" end="00:12:49.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, madam, even a thief is allowed to</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.899" end="00:12:52.199" style="s2">keep his photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.199" end="00:12:52.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mind your own gate.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.299" end="00:13:02.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hid your lecture notes and your papa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.299" end="00:13:03.899" style="s2">old wristwatch. They were going into the</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.299" end="00:13:05.899" style="s2">bin.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.899" end="00:13:07.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bimpe, go back inside before your mother</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.899" end="00:13:11.999" style="s2">sees you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.699" end="00:13:11.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is my mother and I am not blind.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.199" end="00:13:19.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My cousin paid for my JAMB form with her</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.099" end="00:13:20.099" style="s2">own exam money. I can carry one box for</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.299" end="00:13:23.799" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.099" end="00:13:23.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bimpe, inside now.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.899" end="00:13:41.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, the car is ready. Leave nothing of</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.899" end="00:13:41.699" style="s2">yours on this road.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.699" end="00:13:47.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And tell your clerk something from me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.899" end="00:13:50.399" style="s2">If he brings you back, the debt comes</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.799" end="00:13:50.399" style="s2">back with you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.999" end="00:14:05.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you standing like a waiter at a</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.799" end="00:14:08.999" style="s2">wedding? Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.699" end="00:14:12.899" style="s2">And you, clerk, sit too.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.999" end="00:14:12.899" style="s2">Nobody eats my pepper on his feet.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.199" end="00:14:18.301" style="s2">What is it, my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.701" end="00:14:22.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seven years I cooked in my uncle&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.501" end="00:14:26.801" style="s2">house, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.901" end="00:14:26.801" style="s2">And not one day did I eat at that table.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.601" end="00:14:32.001" style="s2">I ate standing in the kitchen, so I</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.401" end="00:14:35.001" style="s2">would hear when they called me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.001" end="00:14:35.001" style="s2">Seven years.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.701" end="00:14:40.601" style="s2">I washed my auntie&#39;s lace by hand</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.901" end="00:14:42.601" style="s2">because she said machines are for people</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.601" end="00:14:45.401" style="s2">who pay for them.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.601" end="00:14:47.101" style="s2">I read my books under the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.401" end="00:14:49.101" style="s2">I told myself</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.101" end="00:14:50.601" style="s2">one day I will graduate in front of</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.101" end="00:14:52.901" style="s2">everybody</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.601" end="00:14:54.701" style="s2">and then they will see me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.901" end="00:14:58.301" style="s2">This morning my own people put my</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.701" end="00:14:58.301" style="s2">mother&#39;s photograph on the road.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.201" end="00:15:04.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.201" end="00:15:06.801" style="s2">A girl cannot face the world in one</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.301" end="00:15:06.801" style="s2">dress.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.901" end="00:15:12.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma,</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.901" end="00:15:15.401" style="s2">I have been given away once this week.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.301" end="00:15:17.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not be bought as well.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.401" end="00:15:20.201" style="s2">Then earn it. Ademola Capital takes</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.701" end="00:15:21.301" style="s2">graduate trainees. The test is on Monday</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.201" end="00:15:21.901" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.301" end="00:15:24.501" style="s2">You will write it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.901" end="00:15:26.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company my uncle owes?</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.501" end="00:15:30.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company that will pay you a debt are</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.601" end="00:15:30.501" style="s2">paid with salaries, not with girls.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.401" end="00:15:39.901" style="s2">Drink, clerk. A clerk must learn to</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.301" end="00:15:44.101" style="s2">swallow.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.901" end="00:15:44.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Monday then. I will write it on Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.901" end="00:16:04.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bakare.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.301" end="00:16:05.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any relation to Jide Bakare of Jide</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.101" end="00:16:08.301" style="s2">Motors?</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.401" end="00:16:09.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His late brother&#39;s daughter, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:11.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you know what your family owes this</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.801" end="00:16:13.701" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.501" end="00:16:17.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what my uncle owes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.701" end="00:16:17.001" style="s2">I came here to write a test.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.002" end="00:16:31.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She finished before most of us had</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.602" end="00:16:34.402" style="s2">turned the second page.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.502" end="00:16:36.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Recovery. My department.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.402" end="00:16:39.102" style="s2">Where I can see her.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.502" end="00:16:41.402" style="s2">Bakare, you start now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.102" end="00:16:43.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my department, Bakare,</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.402" end="00:16:46.102" style="s2">you touch nothing with your family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.402" end="00:16:46.102" style="s2">name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.902" end="00:16:58.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is the clerk&#39;s wife. Two days in</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.302" end="00:17:01.702" style="s2">recovery and she has not gone home</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.902" end="00:17:01.702" style="s2">before 7:00.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.502" end="00:17:06.602" style="s2">I am nobody&#39;s wife, auntie.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.502" end="00:17:09.702" style="s2">I am a trainee who cannot leave a column</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.602" end="00:17:09.702" style="s2">that does not add up.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.002" end="00:17:19.302" style="s2">Clerk, this tea is punishment. Is this</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.602" end="00:17:20.802" style="s2">how you treat a woman who works this</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.302" end="00:17:22.502" style="s2">hard?</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.802" end="00:17:26.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She drinks it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.502" end="00:17:26.202" style="s2">That is how I know she is serious.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.202" end="00:17:31.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at these. 11 loans, all marked</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.702" end="00:17:33.402" style="s2">settled.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.802" end="00:17:34.602" style="s2">I checked everyone against the bank</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.402" end="00:17:37.302" style="s2">statements.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.602" end="00:17:40.202" style="s2">Not one kobo ever came in.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.302" end="00:17:42.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 11 in two days.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.202" end="00:17:45.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And every approval carries the same</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.102" end="00:17:45.902" style="s2">signature, the head of credit.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.202" end="00:17:54.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you learn to read a statement</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.802" end="00:17:54.402" style="s2">like that?</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.102" end="00:17:58.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From Papa.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.702" end="00:18:00.302" style="s2">He was an accountant.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.602" end="00:18:03.702" style="s2">When I was 10,</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.302" end="00:18:05.902" style="s2">a lender took his first shop.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.702" end="00:18:07.502" style="s2">I sat on the empty counter and cried,</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.902" end="00:18:09.102" style="s2">and he told me</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.502" end="00:18:10.702" style="s2">they can take the shop,</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.102" end="00:18:11.902" style="s2">but nobody can repossess what you</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.702" end="00:18:13.702" style="s2">learned.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.902" end="00:18:15.902" style="s2">So who do I give this to?</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.702" end="00:18:18.802" style="s2">Not Mr. Okon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.902" end="00:18:22.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it to me. I know where it goes.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.802" end="00:18:22.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will lose it under your tea.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.303" end="00:18:27.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will guard it with my life</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.903" end="00:18:27.403" style="s2">and my tea.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.303" end="00:18:47.603" style="s2">My late brother&#39;s house, Alhaji.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.903" end="00:18:50.603" style="s2">Five bedrooms, the old mango tree, and</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.603" end="00:18:52.503" style="s2">the best evening light in Ikoyi.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.603" end="00:18:56.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The light I can see.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.503" end="00:18:56.003" style="s2">I am asking about the owner.</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.403" end="00:19:03.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother left one child, a daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.303" end="00:19:04.503" style="s2">She has consented.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.003" end="00:19:08.303" style="s2">She married in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.503" end="00:19:08.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And wants nothing to do with Lagos.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.403" end="00:19:12.803" style="s2">Then she will not mind if I see her</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.303" end="00:19:12.803" style="s2">paper.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.303" end="00:19:18.503" style="s2">I buy nothing without the heir&#39;s own</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.903" end="00:19:20.703" style="s2">hand on it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.503" end="00:19:23.403" style="s2">On Saturday the 25th</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.703" end="00:19:27.703" style="s2">my money comes with my eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.403" end="00:19:27.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will see every page, Alhaji.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.403" end="00:19:33.603" style="s2">Funke, tell her about the party.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.503" end="00:19:35.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We do it right here, Alhaji, under the</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.603" end="00:19:37.903" style="s2">mango tree.</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.003" end="00:19:40.503" style="s2">A live band, small chops. The keys</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.903" end="00:19:42.803" style="s2">handed over at 4:00.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.503" end="00:19:44.903" style="s2">So all Lagos sees this house went to a</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.803" end="00:19:47.103" style="s2">good owner.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.903" end="00:19:48.803" style="s2">You threw a party to sell a dead man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.103" end="00:19:50.703" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.803" end="00:19:53.403" style="s2">We throw a party for the house&#39;s new</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.703" end="00:19:53.403" style="s2">life, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.803" end="00:20:09.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave that thing alone. She will notice.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.103" end="00:20:12.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That woman&#39;s eyes have followed me round</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.003" end="00:20:12.503" style="s2">this room for seven years.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.903" end="00:20:22.403" style="s2">Your brother&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.103" end="00:20:22.403" style="s2">Does she look like her mother?</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.903" end="00:20:27.105" style="s2">Her Her had a face you do not forget.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.905" end="00:20:42.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A man of 33, still a clerk. What</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.705" end="00:20:44.405" style="s2">happened to you?</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.605" end="00:20:47.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing happened. I am learning a</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.405" end="00:20:49.505" style="s2">company from the bottom drawer up.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.505" end="00:20:51.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the tea? Do they teach you that at</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.505" end="00:20:55.705" style="s2">the bottom too?</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.505" end="00:20:55.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. The tea is my own talent.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.205" end="00:21:02.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I tell you something my uncle never</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.205" end="00:21:02.405" style="s2">wanted said out loud?</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.105" end="00:21:07.905" style="s2">Papa left a will.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.205" end="00:21:10.205" style="s2">The day I put my degree certificate in</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.905" end="00:21:12.705" style="s2">his barrister&#39;s hand, his house in Ikoyi</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.205" end="00:21:14.505" style="s2">becomes mine, not my uncle&#39;s, mine.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.705" end="00:21:16.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the barrister?</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.505" end="00:21:19.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In London since August. He comes back on</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.705" end="00:21:21.305" style="s2">the 24th of this month.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.605" end="00:21:23.705" style="s2">And the funny part? I have never even</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.305" end="00:21:25.405" style="s2">seen my certificate.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.705" end="00:21:26.905" style="s2">They called my name</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.405" end="00:21:29.705" style="s2">and I was standing on the Lagoon Road</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.905" end="00:21:29.705" style="s2">with one bag.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.105" end="00:21:37.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will hold your certificate in your</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.505" end="00:21:39.005" style="s2">hand. I promise you that.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.705" end="00:21:41.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How?</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.005" end="00:21:41.705" style="s2">You make tea?</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.005" end="00:21:47.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will make a very strong cup</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.405" end="00:21:47.405" style="s2">and go and ask for it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.505" end="00:21:56.405" style="s2">You are the first man who never told me</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.505" end="00:21:56.405" style="s2">to forget it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.105" end="00:22:08.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, look at our house girl in a blazer.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.405" end="00:22:13.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunty, I am at work. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.705" end="00:22:20.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work? Who bought you this jacket? The</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.105" end="00:22:22.605" style="s2">clerk? Or did you take it from my</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.705" end="00:22:25.105" style="s2">wardrobe with my gold earrings the week</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.605" end="00:22:25.105" style="s2">you left?</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.805" end="00:22:31.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have never touched your earrings.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.706" end="00:22:31.306" style="s2">Everybody in that house knows it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.706" end="00:22:38.706" style="s2">Everybody in this bank should know it</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.406" end="00:22:42.306" style="s2">too. Seven years under my roof and she</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.706" end="00:22:42.306" style="s2">still counts other people&#39;s things.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.606" end="00:22:48.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Bakare,</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.906" end="00:22:53.006" style="s2">you are early for your appointment.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.606" end="00:22:54.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Okon, I came to talk about Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.006" end="00:22:56.606" style="s2">And I find this one parading in your</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.506" end="00:22:59.706" style="s2">lobby. Remove her from where decent</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.606" end="00:22:59.706" style="s2">customers can see her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.906" end="00:23:04.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bakare,</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.006" end="00:23:05.206" style="s2">the archive, basement.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.306" end="00:23:08.306" style="s2">From today.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.206" end="00:23:11.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, my report is not finished upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.306" end="00:23:11.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then finish it downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.206" end="00:23:23.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Basement. At least you will be near the</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.206" end="00:23:23.006" style="s2">floor, you know.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.106" end="00:23:39.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jollof.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.406" end="00:23:41.506" style="s2">Mama sent it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.906" end="00:23:43.106" style="s2">She said a basement is no reason to</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.506" end="00:23:44.906" style="s2">starve.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.106" end="00:23:47.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell Mama the basement is quieter than</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.906" end="00:23:47.906" style="s2">my uncle&#39;s kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.206" end="00:24:02.106" style="s2">Everything down here is open. Why is</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.306" end="00:24:02.106" style="s2">that one locked?</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.706" end="00:24:13.906" style="s2">Why would a car dealer&#39;s file need a</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.406" end="00:24:13.906" style="s2">lock?</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:18.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some people pay to keep their papers</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.306" end="00:24:20.606" style="s2">dusty.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.706" end="00:24:23.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Mr. Okon put me in this basement</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.606" end="00:24:23.606" style="s2">right beside it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.507" end="00:24:43.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She works in that company now, my</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.908" end="00:24:46.307" style="s2">husband, in the same building as your</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.908" end="00:24:46.307" style="s2">file.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.607" end="00:24:52.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her work. Okong keeps the file under</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.107" end="00:24:52.807" style="s2">lock and key.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.807" end="00:24:59.908" style="s2">And on Saturday, the paper says what I</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.807" end="00:24:59.908" style="s2">say. She signed it in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.007" end="00:25:06.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In Abuja, while she sat in Lagos</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.107" end="00:25:09.507" style="s2">sweating over her exam.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.007" end="00:25:09.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The paper does not sweat.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.607" end="00:25:17.507" style="s2">Bimpe,</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.807" end="00:25:17.507" style="s2">come down here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.107" end="00:25:26.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, I only came for water.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.107" end="00:25:28.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then hear something with your water.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.507" end="00:25:30.107" style="s2">What you heard tonight stays in this</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.408" end="00:25:32.908" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.107" end="00:25:35.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, that house is hers. Uncle left it</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.908" end="00:25:37.707" style="s2">to her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.207" end="00:25:41.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who pays your school fees?</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.707" end="00:25:41.507" style="s2">Your uncle in his grave?</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.607" end="00:25:48.807" style="s2">One word of this outside this house</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.307" end="00:25:50.908" style="s2">and you go to your grandmother in</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.807" end="00:25:54.107" style="s2">Ogbomosho</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.908" end="00:25:55.707" style="s2">and you can forget that university.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.107" end="00:25:58.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard your father.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.707" end="00:25:58.707" style="s2">Go and drink your water.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.307" end="00:26:27.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Bakare, relax. The buyer&#39;s lawyer</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.107" end="00:26:31.007" style="s2">wants the original on Saturday, and on</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.908" end="00:26:31.007" style="s2">Saturday he gets it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.007" end="00:26:37.109" style="s2">Until then, it in my safe, and only I</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.409" end="00:26:37.109" style="s2">have the code.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.409" end="00:26:45.509" style="s2">Clerk,</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.509" end="00:26:48.309" style="s2">two months in my department, and I still</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.509" end="00:26:50.809" style="s2">do not know what you are for.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.309" end="00:26:50.809" style="s2">Tea, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.109" end="00:27:01.009" style="s2">This tea is a crime.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.009" end="00:27:04.509" style="s2">If we charge customers for it, we would</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.009" end="00:27:04.509" style="s2">not need a recovery department.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.109" end="00:27:11.009" style="s2">I will put more sugar next time, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.509" end="00:27:13.109" style="s2">Put less water and more sense.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.009" end="00:27:14.309" style="s2">In my department, even the tea must add</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.109" end="00:27:16.209" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.309" end="00:27:18.209" style="s2">And tell that wife of yours something</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.209" end="00:27:20.609" style="s2">from me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.209" end="00:27:24.009" style="s2">She is not my wife, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.609" end="00:27:27.109" style="s2">Then tell whatever she is.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.009" end="00:27:29.909" style="s2">The archive closes at 6 o&#39;clock.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.109" end="00:27:33.409" style="s2">If I find her anywhere near my shelf,</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.909" end="00:27:36.409" style="s2">she goes out of this building.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.409" end="00:27:36.409" style="s2">And you go out behind her.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.709" end="00:27:39.909" style="s2">And mind what Teston tells us.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.809" end="00:27:58.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gently, my daughter. These knees have</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.109" end="00:27:59.909" style="s2">carried me through two husbands&#39; worth</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.309" end="00:28:01.009" style="s2">of trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.909" end="00:28:03.409" style="s2">Tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.009" end="00:28:07.909" style="s2">what was your hardest exam?</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.409" end="00:28:10.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auditing, ma. Friday, the 14th of March.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.909" end="00:28:13.009" style="s2">I had malaria that whole week.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.709" end="00:28:14.909" style="s2">I phoned my uncle that morning, but he</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.009" end="00:28:16.709" style="s2">had traveled to Abuja, and he did not</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.909" end="00:28:19.109" style="s2">pick up.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.709" end="00:28:21.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you wrote it like that?</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.109" end="00:28:25.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 hours in Hall B with a fever. I came</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.709" end="00:28:28.709" style="s2">out at noon and lay down on the steps,</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.509" end="00:28:28.709" style="s2">and I still came first.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.209" end="00:28:32.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear me well.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.009" end="00:28:34.910" style="s2">A thing given away by the wrong hand</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.809" end="00:28:36.410" style="s2">still belongs to its owner.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.910" end="00:28:37.910" style="s2">Remember that, my daughter, when the day</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.410" end="00:28:39.110" style="s2">comes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.910" end="00:28:42.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which day, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.110" end="00:28:45.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will know it. Now, this Ocon who</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.010" end="00:28:47.310" style="s2">sends a first-class girl to a basement,</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.110" end="00:28:49.210" style="s2">I will report him to the chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.310" end="00:28:51.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, have you ever even seen the</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.210" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">chairman?</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.310" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once or twice.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.410" end="00:29:01.510" style="s2">And that clerk of mine, he looks at you</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.410" end="00:29:04.310" style="s2">like a man counting his blessings and</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.510" end="00:29:04.310" style="s2">losing count.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.310" end="00:29:29.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You put on sunglasses to drink a</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.010" end="00:29:29.610" style="s2">smoothie.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.710" end="00:29:37.310" style="s2">If mommy&#39;s friends see me with you, she</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.510" end="00:29:39.810" style="s2">hears in 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.310" end="00:29:42.610" style="s2">I can only tell you one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.810" end="00:29:44.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me the one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.610" end="00:29:47.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy is selling uncle&#39;s house next</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.610" end="00:29:49.210" style="s2">Saturday to a rich woman, Alhaja. Mommy</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.410" end="00:29:51.410" style="s2">is throwing a party there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.210" end="00:29:53.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He cannot. That house is mine the day I</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.410" end="00:29:55.510" style="s2">give Barrister my certificate.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.610" end="00:29:57.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy says you agreed</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.510" end="00:29:59.410" style="s2">on paper.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.310" end="00:30:01.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agreed to nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.410" end="00:30:03.610" style="s2">I have not even held a pen near that</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.110" end="00:30:03.610" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.310" end="00:30:14.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bimpe,</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.510" end="00:30:15.410" style="s2">what else?</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.310" end="00:30:17.810" style="s2">Please,</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.410" end="00:30:19.810" style="s2">if daddy knows I told you this much, I</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.810" end="00:30:23.110" style="s2">am finished.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.810" end="00:30:23.110" style="s2">He will send me to Ogbomosho.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.210" end="00:30:33.410" style="s2">That is where I stay now in Ikoyi.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.710" end="00:30:33.410" style="s2">If you ever need me, come there.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.710" end="00:30:40.712" style="s2">Keep your money.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.110" end="00:30:43.212" style="s2">You are still a student.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.712" end="00:30:46.212" style="s2">So are you or you were till they stole</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.212" end="00:30:46.212" style="s2">your graduation.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.112" end="00:30:51.512" style="s2">Then I need my certificate before next</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.912" end="00:30:51.512" style="s2">Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.712" end="00:31:06.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tulani,</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.812" end="00:31:09.112" style="s2">I have not seen your face since your</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.212" end="00:31:09.112" style="s2">father&#39;s burial.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.612" end="00:31:17.112" style="s2">Your uncle told me you married in Abuja</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.212" end="00:31:17.112" style="s2">and wanted nothing to do with the house.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.812" end="00:31:24.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is a lie, sir. I did not marry in</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.112" end="00:31:24.212" style="s2">Abuja. I want my father&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.112" end="00:31:31.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was very sure.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.312" end="00:31:35.112" style="s2">He said you were too busy with your new</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.812" end="00:31:35.112" style="s2">husband to come to the phone.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.812" end="00:31:41.512" style="s2">I wondered why my old friend&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.512" end="00:31:43.912" style="s2">child never once called me in seven</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.512" end="00:31:43.912" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.612" end="00:31:48.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because nobody gave me your number after</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.512" end="00:31:51.512" style="s2">the burial, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.612" end="00:31:53.712" style="s2">My uncle kept it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.512" end="00:31:55.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then your father&#39;s words stand.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.712" end="00:31:58.512" style="s2">The day you put your degree certificate</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.512" end="00:32:01.012" style="s2">in my hand, the house is yours and</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.512" end="00:32:04.112" style="s2">nobody else signs for it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.012" end="00:32:04.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When do you come home, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.312" end="00:32:08.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I land in Lagos on Friday the 24th.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.012" end="00:32:10.812" style="s2">Bring me that certificate and we finish</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.612" end="00:32:10.812" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.212" end="00:32:18.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Monday I go to the university and</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.812" end="00:32:19.212" style="s2">collect my certificate.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.212" end="00:32:22.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.212" end="00:32:26.612" style="s2">and ask them who has it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.312" end="00:32:26.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who would have it except the registry?</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.513" end="00:32:47.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.913" end="00:32:49.713" style="s2">Where were you?</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.513" end="00:32:51.913" style="s2">Your name was called in that hall and</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.713" end="00:32:53.613" style="s2">nobody stood.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.913" end="00:32:56.713" style="s2">My uncle took me out of the line before</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.613" end="00:32:56.713" style="s2">the doors opened, Prof.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.413" end="00:33:02.113" style="s2">I was sitting on a bag by the lagoon</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.313" end="00:33:02.113" style="s2">when they called me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.313" end="00:33:07.213" style="s2">Then hear me well.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.313" end="00:33:09.313" style="s2">Your certificate and your prize were</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.213" end="00:33:12.913" style="s2">collected on that stage by the guest of</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.313" end="00:33:14.913" style="s2">honor, the chairman of Ademola Capital.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.913" end="00:33:18.113" style="s2">He told the whole hall he would put them</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.913" end="00:33:18.113" style="s2">in your hand himself.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.313" end="00:33:23.513" style="s2">Ademola Capital?</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.913" end="00:33:25.613" style="s2">Prof, I work there in recovery. I walk</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.513" end="00:33:27.413" style="s2">under his office every morning</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.613" end="00:33:28.313" style="s2">and I have never once set eyes on the</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.413" end="00:33:30.413" style="s2">man.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.313" end="00:33:32.213" style="s2">Then you know where his office is.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.413" end="00:33:34.713" style="s2">That is more than most people know about</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.213" end="00:33:34.713" style="s2">a chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.213" end="00:33:41.813" style="s2">The prize-giving dinner on Saturday, the</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.013" end="00:33:43.113" style="s2">1st of November, they will call your</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.813" end="00:33:45.713" style="s2">name again</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.113" end="00:33:47.713" style="s2">and this time I want to see you stand.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.713" end="00:33:51.513" style="s2">His name is on my prize and my</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.713" end="00:33:54.013" style="s2">certificate is in his hands.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.513" end="00:33:57.613" style="s2">A man I have never met.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.013" end="00:33:59.313" style="s2">Then ask him for them politely first.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.613" end="00:34:01.913" style="s2">Then I will go and ask the chairman for</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.313" end="00:34:01.913" style="s2">my own name.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.013" end="00:34:18.413" style="s2">Good afternoon. Can I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.513" end="00:34:20.613" style="s2">Good afternoon, ma. Tolani Bakare,</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.413" end="00:34:22.813" style="s2">trainee in recovery. I would like five</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.613" end="00:34:24.313" style="s2">minutes with the chairman, please.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.813" end="00:34:26.513" style="s2">The chairman sees nobody without an</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.313" end="00:34:30.013" style="s2">appointment and to be honest with you,</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.513" end="00:34:30.013" style="s2">he is rarely at this desk.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.413" end="00:34:36.413" style="s2">You may leave him a note. I will make</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.213" end="00:34:36.413" style="s2">sure it reaches his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.613" end="00:34:46.314" style="s2">Sir, you hold my certificate. The house</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.314" end="00:34:48.914" style="s2">my father left me is being sold on</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.314" end="00:34:50.714" style="s2">Saturday, the 25th.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.914" end="00:34:51.814" style="s2">Without my certificate, I cannot stop</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.714" end="00:34:53.914" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.814" end="00:34:56.314" style="s2">Please put my certificate in my hand as</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.914" end="00:34:59.714" style="s2">you promised the hall.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.314" end="00:35:03.714" style="s2">I will hold you to that promise.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.714" end="00:35:05.214" style="s2">Tolani Bakare, trainee recovery.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.714" end="00:35:07.414" style="s2">He made that promise before a whole</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.214" end="00:35:09.214" style="s2">hall, ma. I only came upstairs to remind</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.414" end="00:35:13.014" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.214" end="00:35:13.014" style="s2">I will put it on his desk myself.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.014" end="00:35:22.314" style="s2">Sir, she was here.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.414" end="00:35:36.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have read that paper twice. Is the</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.514" end="00:35:36.714" style="s2">third time for the grammar.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.614" end="00:35:45.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will hold you to that promise. She</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.414" end="00:35:47.414" style="s2">wrote that to a man she has never met.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.514" end="00:35:49.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has met him. She drinks his tea</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.414" end="00:35:50.714" style="s2">every morning.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.214" end="00:35:51.914" style="s2">Chairman, I am reporting you to</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.714" end="00:35:55.714" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.914" end="00:35:55.714" style="s2">The girl is asking for what is hers.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.314" end="00:36:02.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, one more thing from the office.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.614" end="00:36:04.314" style="s2">Okon booked two porters through the</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.314" end="00:36:05.714" style="s2">transport desk.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.314" end="00:36:07.614" style="s2">Tomorrow night, they carry the Bakare</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.714" end="00:36:10.314" style="s2">boxes down to the archive to be sealed</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.614" end="00:36:13.314" style="s2">for the buyer&#39;s lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.314" end="00:36:14.914" style="s2">The archive, her floor.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.314" end="00:36:17.914" style="s2">Her floor, sir. After 6:00 when</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.914" end="00:36:17.914" style="s2">everybody has gone home.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.714" end="00:36:21.814" style="s2">Then for one night, that file leaves his</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.514" end="00:36:25.514" style="s2">office</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.814" end="00:36:25.514" style="s2">and it sits in the room where she works.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.314" end="00:36:34.914" style="s2">Dear Miss Bakare,</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.914" end="00:36:37.414" style="s2">your certificate is safe. It will be put</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.914" end="00:36:39.814" style="s2">in your hand before the whole house</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.414" end="00:36:41.714" style="s2">on the day it matters most. Kehinde</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.814" end="00:36:43.916" style="s2">Mola, Chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.714" end="00:36:47.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are making a promise you can only</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.916" end="00:36:48.916" style="s2">keep in public. You know that?</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.116" end="00:36:52.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.916" end="00:36:54.316" style="s2">She asked for her own name, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.416" end="00:36:56.516" style="s2">A name is not handed back in a back</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.316" end="00:36:56.516" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.416" end="00:37:15.116" style="s2">Oga, where we go drop them? Inside the</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.316" end="00:37:15.116" style="s2">cage or for table?</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.916" end="00:37:20.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beside the cage.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.916" end="00:37:21.916" style="s2">The buyer&#39;s lawyer seals them in the</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.616" end="00:37:25.416" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.916" end="00:37:25.416" style="s2">Nobody touches them before then.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.116" end="00:37:32.116" style="s2">Bakare,</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.516" end="00:37:32.116" style="s2">why are you still here? Go home.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.616" end="00:37:38.916" style="s2">These boxes belong to a customer.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.216" end="00:37:40.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I have one row left to label. If I</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.916" end="00:37:44.116" style="s2">leave it half done, the morning team</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.516" end="00:37:44.116" style="s2">will mix up 200 files.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.416" end="00:37:54.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 minutes. I have a meeting at 6:00 and</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.816" end="00:37:56.416" style="s2">I do not wait for trainees.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.216" end="00:37:58.316" style="s2">When you go, the lights go off and that</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.416" end="00:38:00.816" style="s2">door locks behind you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.316" end="00:38:02.016" style="s2">Oga, the trolley nko?</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.816" end="00:38:04.516" style="s2">Bring it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.016" end="00:38:04.516" style="s2">We are going.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.416" end="00:38:22.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bakare,</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.816" end="00:38:25.316" style="s2">sale of property, Ikoyi.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.316" end="00:38:28.416" style="s2">Saturday the 25th at 4:00.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.316" end="00:38:28.416" style="s2">That is Papa&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.916" end="00:38:32.316" style="s2">That is the house I grew up in.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.416" end="00:38:36.416" style="s2">Mr. Okon,</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.816" end="00:38:38.316" style="s2">you told me to touch nothing with my</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.416" end="00:38:41.816" style="s2">family&#39;s name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.316" end="00:38:41.816" style="s2">This box has my father&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.316" end="00:38:49.017" style="s2">I, only child and heir of the late Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.517" end="00:38:52.217" style="s2">Bakare, consent to the sale of my late</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.017" end="00:38:52.217" style="s2">father&#39;s house in Ikoyi.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.617" end="00:38:58.517" style="s2">That is not my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.517" end="00:39:01.017" style="s2">I have never made a tea like that in my</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.517" end="00:39:01.017" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.217" end="00:39:05.517" style="s2">Signed in Abuja before me,</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.617" end="00:39:08.017" style="s2">notary public,</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.517" end="00:39:10.117" style="s2">Friday, the 14th of March</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.017" end="00:39:11.917" style="s2">at 11 in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.117" end="00:39:14.317" style="s2">And the witness line</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.917" end="00:39:17.717" style="s2">in my uncle&#39;s own writing.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.317" end="00:39:17.717" style="s2">She signed it in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.017" end="00:39:26.817" style="s2">The 14th of March.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.917" end="00:39:29.117" style="s2">At 11 o&#39;clock on the 14th of March, I</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.817" end="00:39:31.417" style="s2">was in Hall B writing, auditing with</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.117" end="00:39:33.617" style="s2">malaria.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.417" end="00:39:36.117" style="s2">3 hours and I did not leave my seat</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.617" end="00:39:36.117" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.217" end="00:39:56.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guard said you you were still down</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.817" end="00:39:58.817" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.217" end="00:39:58.817" style="s2">I brought tea.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.917" end="00:40:05.817" style="s2">Tolani,</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.917" end="00:40:05.817" style="s2">what did you find in there?</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.417" end="00:40:14.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My uncle did not only give me away with</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.717" end="00:40:14.417" style="s2">my own name.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.817" end="00:40:29.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have not said one word since the</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.317" end="00:40:31.817" style="s2">car.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.317" end="00:40:31.817" style="s2">Say it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.817" end="00:40:36.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It says I signed it in front of him in</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.717" end="00:40:39.317" style="s2">Abuja at 11 o&#39;clock on the 14th of</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.817" end="00:40:39.317" style="s2">March.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.117" end="00:40:45.417" style="s2">He witnessed my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.117" end="00:40:48.117" style="s2">A hand that was in Lagos that morning</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.417" end="00:40:49.417" style="s2">holding a pen in Hall B, shaking with</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.117" end="00:40:49.718" style="s2">fever.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.417" end="00:40:51.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who else</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.718" end="00:40:52.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; was in that hall?</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.718" end="00:40:55.718" style="s2">300 students.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.918" end="00:40:57.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The professor walked the rows herself.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.718" end="00:40:59.018" style="s2">She brought me water because I could not</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.118" end="00:41:01.018" style="s2">stop coughing.</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.018" end="00:41:03.718" style="s2">And while she was pouring it,</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.018" end="00:41:06.718" style="s2">my uncle was telling a notary in Abuja</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.718" end="00:41:06.718" style="s2">that I was front of him.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.618" end="00:41:11.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the house?</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.918" end="00:41:16.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With my name and a pen that never</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.818" end="00:41:16.818" style="s2">touched my fingers.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.618" end="00:41:22.818" style="s2">On Saturday, they hand Papa&#39;s keys to a</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.018" end="00:41:26.618" style="s2">to a stranger</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.818" end="00:41:26.618" style="s2">and throw a party in his garden.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.418" end="00:41:30.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani,</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.518" end="00:41:32.718" style="s2">I have seen that paper before, a copy of</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.818" end="00:41:34.118" style="s2">it in your uncle&#39;s file in our</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.718" end="00:41:36.518" style="s2">department</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.118" end="00:41:39.218" style="s2">the day before your graduation.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.518" end="00:41:41.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before my graduation</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.218" end="00:41:43.618" style="s2">and you said nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.318" end="00:41:45.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A copy is not proof and the original is</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.618" end="00:41:46.718" style="s2">locked in Okon&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.418" end="00:41:49.818" style="s2">If he knew anybody was looking, it would</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.718" end="00:41:49.818" style="s2">be ashes by morning.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.618" end="00:41:53.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more man deciding what I should know</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.318" end="00:41:57.118" style="s2">about my own life.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.918" end="00:42:00.618" style="s2">My uncle decided who would take me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.118" end="00:42:00.618" style="s2">You decided what I could carry.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.418" end="00:42:06.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are right.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.918" end="00:42:09.218" style="s2">So you decide now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.618" end="00:42:09.218" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.518" end="00:42:15.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to stand in my father&#39;s house on</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.218" end="00:42:17.918" style="s2">Saturday when they ask for the air. I</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.318" end="00:42:21.418" style="s2">want to be in that room.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.918" end="00:42:23.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will stand at the back of it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.418" end="00:42:26.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And do not keep one more thing from me,</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.518" end="00:42:26.118" style="s2">not one.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.518" end="00:42:31.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After Saturday, you will know everything</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.218" end="00:42:31.718" style="s2">about me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.518" end="00:42:45.118" style="s2">Watch, 7 minutes past 6 last night.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.218" end="00:42:51.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That girl found it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.818" end="00:42:54.320" style="s2">She will bring that phone to Saturday</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.420" end="00:42:56.820" style="s2">and wave it in Alhaji&#39;s face.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.320" end="00:42:58.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lower your voice, Mr. Bakare.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.820" end="00:43:01.620" style="s2">This building has ears,</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.820" end="00:43:03.220" style="s2">and most of them are paid by me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.620" end="00:43:05.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we do?</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.220" end="00:43:07.720" style="s2">The barrister lands on Friday. On</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.620" end="00:43:09.520" style="s2">Saturday at 4:00, she will be standing</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.720" end="00:43:10.920" style="s2">in that parlor.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.520" end="00:43:13.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She will not.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.920" end="00:43:15.720" style="s2">Tomorrow morning, I report the original</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.020" end="00:43:19.520" style="s2">consent stolen from our archive, and the</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.720" end="00:43:22.120" style="s2">camera shows who opened the box.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.520" end="00:43:24.520" style="s2">By lunch, she is in handcuffs.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.120" end="00:43:27.720" style="s2">A thief cannot stand up in a parlor and</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.520" end="00:43:27.720" style="s2">call herself an heir.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.720" end="00:43:41.420" style="s2">From today, this paper does not leave my</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.920" end="00:43:42.820" style="s2">hand.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.420" end="00:43:45.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the clerk?</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.820" end="00:43:47.720" style="s2">He lives in the same house with her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.420" end="00:43:50.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A clerk, he carries my tea, and he</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.720" end="00:43:50.820" style="s2">cannot even make it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.820" end="00:44:03.720" style="s2">And this part nobody needs to see.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.320" end="00:44:13.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow morning, Okon calls the police.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.520" end="00:44:14.620" style="s2">The girl stole the original from their</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.320" end="00:44:17.720" style="s2">archive.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.620" end="00:44:17.720" style="s2">He has her on camera.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.020" end="00:44:21.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stole it?</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.320" end="00:44:23.620" style="s2">That girl is too proud to steal a</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.020" end="00:44:23.620" style="s2">biscuit.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.520" end="00:44:32.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The camera says she opened the box. The</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.920" end="00:44:35.420" style="s2">part where she put everything back, Okon</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.520" end="00:44:35.420" style="s2">lost this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.920" end="00:44:41.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then by Saturday, she is sleeping in a</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.620" end="00:44:45.120" style="s2">cell. And who listens to a thief who</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.820" end="00:44:45.120" style="s2">says her uncle is a liar?</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.720" end="00:44:52.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.320" end="00:44:54.820" style="s2">Alhaji pays, Okon gets his 20,</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.120" end="00:44:55.321" style="s2">and we keep this house.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.820" end="00:44:57.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.321" end="00:44:58.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in that banking hall when the handcuffs</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.021" end="00:45:00.521" style="s2">come out.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.321" end="00:45:03.221" style="s2">With my phone, I have my husband&#39;s file</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.521" end="00:45:03.221" style="s2">to ask about.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.021" end="00:45:06.321" style="s2">Bimpe?</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.221" end="00:45:08.821" style="s2">What are you doing on those stairs at</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.321" end="00:45:08.821" style="s2">this hour?</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.721" end="00:45:13.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water, mummy. I only came down for</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.321" end="00:45:15.521" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.521" end="00:45:18.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ogbomosho is very far, Bimpe. Your</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.521" end="00:45:20.921" style="s2">grandmother&#39;s village has no university.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.321" end="00:45:20.921" style="s2">Go to bed.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.521" end="00:45:44.721" style="s2">From the bank examiners in Abuja,</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.821" end="00:45:48.221" style="s2">the chairman of Ademola Capital will</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.721" end="00:45:50.521" style="s2">appear in person at 10:00 tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.221" end="00:45:53.621" style="s2">to answer for 11 loans marked settled</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.521" end="00:45:56.121" style="s2">with no money received</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.621" end="00:45:59.321" style="s2">or the license is suspended.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.121" end="00:46:01.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 11 loans? Sir, that is her list from her</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.321" end="00:46:01.921" style="s2">first week.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.821" end="00:46:07.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her list?</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.721" end="00:46:10.221" style="s2">I sent it to the examiners myself.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.521" end="00:46:13.021" style="s2">Now they want the chairman&#39;s face.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.221" end="00:46:15.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go. A license is 3,000 people&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.021" end="00:46:17.621" style="s2">salaries. Hers is one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.721" end="00:46:19.421" style="s2">Chuks, you look like a man who has seen</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.621" end="00:46:21.421" style="s2">a ghost.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.421" end="00:46:24.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only a courier, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.421" end="00:46:24.821" style="s2">Courier whispers ghosts.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.921" end="00:46:28.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company is sending me to Abuja with</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.621" end="00:46:32.221" style="s2">the files.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.921" end="00:46:32.221" style="s2">I fly at 6:00 in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.821" end="00:46:37.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay home tomorrow. Let Okon walk that</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.921" end="00:46:38.521" style="s2">basement alone for one day.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.421" end="00:46:40.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.521" end="00:46:42.821" style="s2">I am a trainee. I do not hide from my</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.721" end="00:46:45.221" style="s2">own work.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.821" end="00:46:46.621" style="s2">If I hide on Thursday,</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.221" end="00:46:50.221" style="s2">I walk into my father&#39;s house on</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.621" end="00:46:50.221" style="s2">Saturday already afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.221" end="00:46:57.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chuks, you drive her in tomorrow. You do</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.321" end="00:46:57.622" style="s2">not leave that building until she does.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.121" end="00:46:59.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.622" end="00:47:01.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; does madam&#39;s driver take orders from a</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.323" end="00:47:02.922" style="s2">clerk?</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.122" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He asks me nicely, ma,</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.922" end="00:47:07.723" style="s2">and I obey nicely.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.122" end="00:47:10.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chuks goes with her. I have said it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.723" end="00:47:10.323" style="s2">Finish.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.323" end="00:47:34.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.023" end="00:47:37.023" style="s2">I am sorry to stop the counters, but you</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.122" end="00:47:38.922" style="s2">must all see this.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.023" end="00:47:40.422" style="s2">A customer&#39;s original title document was</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.922" end="00:47:42.723" style="s2">stolen from our archive on Tuesday</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.422" end="00:47:42.723" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.323" end="00:48:02.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, I will ask you once in front of</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.823" end="00:48:03.823" style="s2">your people, where is the document?</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.422" end="00:48:06.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next team.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.823" end="00:48:08.523" style="s2">He showed me rent, and I dittoed her to</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.023" end="00:48:08.523" style="s2">great.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.422" end="00:48:12.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Photographed it to sell to her uncle&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.122" end="00:48:15.922" style="s2">enemies.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.323" end="00:48:19.223" style="s2">The camera shows her opening the box.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.922" end="00:48:20.622" style="s2">Does the camera show her closing it?</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.223" end="00:48:23.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stopped it, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.622" end="00:48:26.023" style="s2">Play the rest of the clip.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.023" end="00:48:26.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no rest.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.922" end="00:48:36.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only came about my husband&#39;s file, and</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.422" end="00:48:39.122" style="s2">look what I find.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.523" end="00:48:41.622" style="s2">I told all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.122" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">7 years she ate in my house, and she was</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.622" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">already counting my spoons.</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.922" end="00:48:50.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that not the girl who topped the</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.323" end="00:48:53.223" style="s2">trainee test?</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.622" end="00:48:55.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Topped it, yes. A clever thief is still</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.223" end="00:48:57.724" style="s2">a thief.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.622" end="00:49:00.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, you know where I was on Tuesday.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.724" end="00:49:00.524" style="s2">and I was working.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.924" end="00:49:17.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adémólá Capital does not employ thieves.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.124" end="00:49:17.924" style="s2">You are dismissed from this minute.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.724" end="00:49:26.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer, she has been in that basement</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.724" end="00:49:29.124" style="s2">every night doing your company&#39;s work.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.224" end="00:49:31.424" style="s2">Somebody called the chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.124" end="00:49:33.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The chairman is in Abuja, my friend, and</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.424" end="00:49:35.524" style="s2">the driver does not give orders in my</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.224" end="00:49:35.524" style="s2">hall.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.724" end="00:49:44.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hands, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.224" end="00:49:44.424" style="s2">You can explain at the station.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.824" end="00:50:00.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lagos, meet Capital&#39;s graduate thief.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.224" end="00:50:22.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look tired, my dear. Concrete is not</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.524" end="00:50:25.124" style="s2">like my sofa.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.324" end="00:50:27.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you come to film me again, auntie?</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.124" end="00:50:29.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to save you because your uncle</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.224" end="00:50:31.624" style="s2">has a soft heart.</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.024" end="00:50:34.724" style="s2">Listen well. Sign a fresh consent</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.624" end="00:50:36.724" style="s2">properly this time with your own hand.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.724" end="00:50:40.524" style="s2">Tomorrow, Okon finds his paper in some</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.724" end="00:50:40.524" style="s2">drawer, the charge goes away.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.624" end="00:50:45.924" style="s2">You walk out of here tonight</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.924" end="00:50:48.924" style="s2">properly this time. So you know the</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.924" end="00:50:51.124" style="s2">first one was never mine.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.924" end="00:50:52.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know nothing. I only know the door of</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.124" end="00:50:55.124" style="s2">this cell.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.824" end="00:50:55.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.824" end="00:51:04.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No?</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.824" end="00:51:07.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your clerk was nowhere in</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.025" end="00:51:07.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; hall the money you needed him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.925" end="00:51:12.325" style="s2">Your madam does not even know where you</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.025" end="00:51:12.325" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.625" end="00:51:19.125" style="s2">Nobody is coming for you, Tolani.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.725" end="00:51:21.725" style="s2">You took my graduation</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.125" end="00:51:25.425" style="s2">and my mother&#39;s photograph</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.725" end="00:51:27.525" style="s2">and now my job and my name for one day.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.425" end="00:51:30.225" style="s2">Take them, auntie. Nobody can repossess</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.525" end="00:51:30.225" style="s2">what I learned.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.725" end="00:51:35.625" style="s2">Then learn to sleep on concrete.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.025" end="00:51:49.425" style="s2">Officer, where is my daughter? The one</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.325" end="00:51:50.925" style="s2">you carried out of a bank like a sack of</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.425" end="00:51:53.825" style="s2">rice.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.925" end="00:51:56.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are her mother, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.825" end="00:51:58.925" style="s2">I am whoever signs your paper.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.325" end="00:51:58.925" style="s2">Give me the pen.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.625" end="00:52:10.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bail, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.725" end="00:52:11.825" style="s2">But the charge stands until that</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.225" end="00:52:13.925" style="s2">document is found.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.825" end="00:52:17.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then find it, officer.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.925" end="00:52:17.025" style="s2">It is not in her pocket.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.725" end="00:52:33.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry, ma. It is on every blog.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.725" end="00:52:34.725" style="s2">Even your classmates group has shared</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.325" end="00:52:38.525" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.725" end="00:52:38.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They took me out of my graduation.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.725" end="00:52:48.825" style="s2">Now my name is on every phone in Lagos</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.525" end="00:52:48.825" style="s2">next to the next to the word thief.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.525" end="00:52:55.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight you cry, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.725" end="00:52:58.625" style="s2">Tomorrow you wash your face and you</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.925" end="00:53:00.225" style="s2">count what they cannot take.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.625" end="00:53:01.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if there is nothing left to count,</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.225" end="00:53:03.725" style="s2">ma?</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.525" end="00:53:05.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you have not counted well. Chuks,</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.725" end="00:53:08.627" style="s2">home. Drive slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.727" end="00:53:08.627" style="s2">Let the girl breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.927" end="00:53:14.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chuks phoned me at the airport in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.227" end="00:53:14.227" style="s2">I came on the last flight.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.127" end="00:54:08.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My uncle&#39;s house,</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.027" end="00:54:08.327" style="s2">madam&#39;s house, it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.427" end="00:54:15.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the original consent was stolen.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.827" end="00:54:17.927" style="s2">On Wednesday, Chuks was outside his</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.627" end="00:54:19.827" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.927" end="00:54:21.527" style="s2">He saw Okon take that paper out of his</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.827" end="00:54:24.127" style="s2">safe and lock it inside his black</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.527" end="00:54:24.127" style="s2">briefcase.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.927" end="00:54:31.027" style="s2">He is carrying the very paper he says</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.727" end="00:54:32.627" style="s2">you took.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.027" end="00:54:34.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; his briefcase</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.627" end="00:54:36.527" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.727" end="00:54:40.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every day.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.527" end="00:54:40.127" style="s2">He does not let it out of his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.927" end="00:54:49.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then on Saturday at 4:00 he will carry</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.627" end="00:54:49.227" style="s2">it into my father&#39;s house himself.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.627" end="00:55:07.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw the video.</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.127" end="00:55:09.128" style="s2">Tell me you did not come here to say</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.628" end="00:55:11.228" style="s2">goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.128" end="00:55:14.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to ask for a book, Prof. The</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.228" end="00:55:16.328" style="s2">attendance register for Hall B.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.328" end="00:55:18.628" style="s2">Auditing, the paper we wrote on Friday</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.328" end="00:55:21.128" style="s2">the 14th of March.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.628" end="00:55:23.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why that one?</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.128" end="00:55:25.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because on that day at 11:00 in the</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.528" end="00:55:27.528" style="s2">morning,</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.328" end="00:55:29.228" style="s2">a paper says I was in Abuja</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.528" end="00:55:32.128" style="s2">signing away away my father&#39;s house in</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.228" end="00:55:32.128" style="s2">front of my uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.828" end="00:55:51.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auditing, Hall B. Here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.628" end="00:55:51.128" style="s2">Tolani Bakare, seat 112.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.828" end="00:55:56.528" style="s2">In at 8:52,</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.028" end="00:55:58.628" style="s2">out at 12:04.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.528" end="00:56:01.328" style="s2">Your signature going in, your signature</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.628" end="00:56:05.328" style="s2">coming out.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.328" end="00:56:05.328" style="s2">And that stamp is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.928" end="00:56:10.928" style="s2">I was the invigilator.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.228" end="00:56:14.228" style="s2">I stood over you for 3 hours with a cold</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.928" end="00:56:14.228" style="s2">towel for your fever</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.428" end="00:56:20.528" style="s2">because you refused to go to the clinic.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.328" end="00:56:21.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prof, tomorrow at 4 in my father&#39;s house</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.528" end="00:56:24.328" style="s2">in Ikoyi,</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.828" end="00:56:25.728" style="s2">they will sell it with that paper.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.328" end="00:56:28.528" style="s2">Will you say what you just said in a</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.728" end="00:56:32.028" style="s2">room full of people?</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.528" end="00:56:32.028" style="s2">Tell me the address and the hour.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.328" end="00:56:41.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The register comes with me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.228" end="00:56:44.328" style="s2">It belongs to the university, and so</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.228" end="00:56:44.328" style="s2">does the truth in it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.228" end="00:56:57.328" style="s2">You sent me this address the day we sat</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.928" end="00:56:59.028" style="s2">in the cafe.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.328" end="00:57:02.528" style="s2">I took two buses.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.028" end="00:57:04.128" style="s2">Bimpe, if your father finds you here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.528" end="00:57:05.628" style="s2">You paid for my JAMB form with your own</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.128" end="00:57:06.928" style="s2">exam money.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.628" end="00:57:08.428" style="s2">And I watched them handcuff you on</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.928" end="00:57:11.429" style="s2">Instagram</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.428" end="00:57:11.429" style="s2">in In mother&#39;s video.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.929" end="00:57:18.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow morning, Okon calls the police.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.529" end="00:57:22.229" style="s2">The girl stole the original from their</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.229" end="00:57:22.229" style="s2">archive. He has her on camera.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.329" end="00:57:25.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then by Saturday, she is sleeping in a</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.329" end="00:57:27.629" style="s2">cell.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.629" end="00:57:29.529" style="s2">And who listens to a thief who says her</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.629" end="00:57:32.129" style="s2">uncle is a liar?</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.529" end="00:57:32.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.129" end="00:57:37.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I recorded it on Wednesday evening on</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.829" end="00:57:39.029" style="s2">the stairs. I hid the phone in my</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.029" end="00:57:41.729" style="s2">pillowcase and I have not slept one full</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.029" end="00:57:41.729" style="s2">hour since.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.029" end="00:57:46.529" style="s2">Then hear the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.729" end="00:57:48.729" style="s2">The signing is at 4:00.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.529" end="00:57:51.029" style="s2">Mommy has hired a high-life band and a</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.729" end="00:57:53.429" style="s2">cake shaped like the house.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.029" end="00:57:55.129" style="s2">Okon is bringing the paper himself. Come</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.429" end="00:57:58.029" style="s2">in through the kitchen door at the side.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.129" end="00:57:58.029" style="s2">I will open it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.729" end="00:58:12.529" style="s2">Good evening, Inspector. This is Tolani</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.929" end="00:58:13.929" style="s2">Bakare, the woman you arrested</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.529" end="00:58:16.529" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.929" end="00:58:18.629" style="s2">You are looking for a document.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.529" end="00:58:21.529" style="s2">Tomorrow at 4:00, it will be in a black</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.629" end="00:58:21.529" style="s2">leather briefcase.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.329" end="00:58:27.529" style="s2">At the Bakare house in Ikoyi, come and</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.229" end="00:58:27.529" style="s2">see whose hand is holding it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.229" end="00:58:32.629" style="s2">If Daddy sends me to Ogbomoso, come and</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.129" end="00:58:32.629" style="s2">visit me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.729" end="00:58:47.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I found it. 5 million naira from GD</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.229" end="00:58:49.129" style="s2">Motors in August</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.329" end="00:58:50.529" style="s2">into an account in the name of Okon&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.129" end="00:58:52.129" style="s2">wife,</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.529" end="00:58:55.229" style="s2">the same week he wrote that settlement</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.129" end="00:58:55.229" style="s2">note on the Bakare file.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.329" end="00:58:59.529" style="s2">So the note was paid for before it was</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.129" end="00:58:59.529" style="s2">written.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.329" end="00:59:06.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alhaji, good afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.329" end="00:59:08.329" style="s2">15 years on that hospital board and you</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.429" end="00:59:09.729" style="s2">still do not save my number.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.329" end="00:59:13.329" style="s2">Listen.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.729" end="00:59:13.329" style="s2">Tomorrow you are buying a house in</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.331" end="00:59:19.231" style="s2">Before you pay one kobo,</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.731" end="00:59:20.531" style="s2">ask for the heir by her name</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.231" end="00:59:23.231" style="s2">in that room,</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.531" end="00:59:25.231" style="s2">in front of everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.231" end="00:59:27.131" style="s2">And bring the late man&#39;s own barrister,</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.231" end="00:59:28.931" style="s2">not their lawyer,</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.131" end="00:59:30.431" style="s2">his.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.931" end="00:59:33.431" style="s2">She said she was going to ask for the</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.431" end="00:59:35.731" style="s2">heir anyway. She only needed a push.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.431" end="00:59:37.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, you should be in this company, not</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.731" end="00:59:39.731" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.331" end="00:59:40.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am in this company. I gave birth to</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.731" end="00:59:42.631" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.931" end="00:59:44.731" style="s2">Now,</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.631" end="00:59:46.631" style="s2">when do you tell her?</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.731" end="00:59:50.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not tonight, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.631" end="00:59:51.831" style="s2">If she hears tonight that the clerk</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.031" end="00:59:53.631" style="s2">is the chairman,</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.831" end="00:59:55.131" style="s2">tomorrow every guest in that house will</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.631" end="00:59:57.831" style="s2">say the chairman&#39;s woman won with the</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.131" end="00:59:57.831" style="s2">chairman&#39;s money.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.231" end="01:00:02.131" style="s2">She found every page of this herself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.631" end="01:00:03.831" style="s2">She will walk into her father &#39;s house</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.131" end="01:00:05.431" style="s2">as herself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.831" end="01:00:07.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you?</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.431" end="01:00:10.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will stand at the back like a clerk</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.531" end="01:00:13.531" style="s2">until she is finished.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.431" end="01:00:13.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stand straight.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.931" end="01:00:44.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome. Welcome to my house. Drink.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.831" end="01:00:47.031" style="s2">Today we are closing an old chapter.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.831" end="01:00:48.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chief, this house is beautiful. Why are</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.031" end="01:00:52.831" style="s2">you selling it?</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.831" end="01:00:52.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I have a bigger one, MY BROTHER.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.431" end="01:01:02.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PLAY, PLAY. TODAY MY HUSBAND is free.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.231" end="01:01:17.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barrister,</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.331" end="01:01:17.332" style="s2">I thought you were in London.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.532" end="01:01:24.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I landed yesterday, Mr. Bakare.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.232" end="01:01:26.132" style="s2">Alhaji asked me to come.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.432" end="01:01:27.632" style="s2">My late client&#39;s house is not sold</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.132" end="01:01:31.732" style="s2">without me in the room.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.632" end="01:01:31.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, Alhaji, of course.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.132" end="01:01:38.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.332" end="01:01:46.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer,</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.332" end="01:01:46.432" style="s2">this is a private party.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.332" end="01:01:51.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was told a stolen document would be</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.332" end="01:01:51.832" style="s2">here, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.932" end="01:01:59.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am only standing</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.832" end="01:02:02.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in everybody into the parlor. Let</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.232" end="01:02:02.232" style="s2">us sign and eat.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.732" end="01:02:18.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who turned that picture around?</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.532" end="01:02:20.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I turned it to the wall myself.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.232" end="01:02:22.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is their house, mommy. Let them</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.232" end="01:02:24.932" style="s2">watch.</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.732" end="01:02:27.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before Alhaji pays, the will of my late</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.932" end="01:02:29.332" style="s2">client asks one question</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.132" end="01:02:31.732" style="s2">and I must ask it aloud.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.332" end="01:02:34.732" style="s2">Is Tolani Bakare in this house?</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.732" end="01:02:36.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barrister, she is married now in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.732" end="01:02:38.532" style="s2">She gave her consent. She signed it in</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.832" end="01:02:41.432" style="s2">front of</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.532" end="01:02:41.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am here, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.232" end="01:02:57.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who let the thief in?</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.332" end="01:02:57.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come forward, my dear.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.932" end="01:03:14.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her mother&#39;s face. Jide, you told me the</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.332" end="01:03:16.533" style="s2">heir had moved to Abuja.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.832" end="01:03:18.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alhaji, this girl was arrested on</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.533" end="01:03:18.933" style="s2">Thursday.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.533" end="01:03:26.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barrister, I signed nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.133" end="01:03:41.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The paper, Mr. Bakare. Let the air see</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.533" end="01:03:41.433" style="s2">what she signed.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.533" end="01:03:50.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Signed in Abuja before a notary public,</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.833" end="01:03:53.533" style="s2">Friday the 14th of March, 11 in the</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.733" end="01:03:55.933" style="s2">morning. Witness, Jide Bakare.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.533" end="01:03:58.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every word of it is true.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.933" end="01:04:00.833" style="s2">She signed it in front of me</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.233" end="01:04:00.833" style="s2">in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.733" end="01:04:11.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At 11 o&#39;clock on the 14th of March,</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.733" end="01:04:13.933" style="s2">uncle, I was not in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.533" end="01:04:18.233" style="s2">I was in Lagos in Hall B of my</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.933" end="01:04:18.233" style="s2">university at seat 112.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.933" end="01:04:28.833" style="s2">I was writing ACC 414 12 auditing.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.433" end="01:04:28.833" style="s2">The paper began at 9 and ended at 12.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.133" end="01:04:36.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lies. She is a trainee.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.133" end="01:04:38.533" style="s2">She knows how to make papers talk.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.033" end="01:04:40.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I had malaria that morning. I phoned you</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.533" end="01:04:41.833" style="s2">twice from the hostel and you did not</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.633" end="01:04:44.933" style="s2">pick up</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.833" end="01:04:44.933" style="s2">because you were in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.133" end="01:04:48.433" style="s2">You were there, uncle. I was not.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.533" end="01:04:50.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.433" end="01:04:52.233" style="s2">So who held the pen?</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.633" end="01:04:55.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who will believe a girl the police</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.233" end="01:04:55.333" style="s2">arrested on Thursday?</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.033" end="01:04:59.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do not believe me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.733" end="01:05:02.733" style="s2">Believe the woman who stood over my desk</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.733" end="01:05:02.733" style="s2">for 3 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.133" end="01:05:06.533" style="s2">Professor, please.</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.733" end="01:05:19.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Attendance register, Hall B, auditing,</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.733" end="01:05:24.535" style="s2">Friday the 14th of March.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.935" end="01:05:28.535" style="s2">Tolani Bakare, seat 112.</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.535" end="01:05:29.835" style="s2">In at 8:52, out at 12:04. Her signature</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.535" end="01:05:32.235" style="s2">twice.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.835" end="01:05:33.535" style="s2">And this red stamp is mine. I was the</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.235" end="01:05:35.635" style="s2">invigilator.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.535" end="01:05:36.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barrister cannot sit in two cities with</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.635" end="01:05:40.335" style="s2">one fever.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.835" end="01:05:40.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We knew she had an exam that</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.135" end="01:05:49.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew she had an exam that day.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.735" end="01:05:49.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I meant I meant she always had exams.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.535" end="01:05:57.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jide,</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.935" end="01:06:00.335" style="s2">you walked me through this house</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.535" end="01:06:03.135" style="s2">and told me the child agreed.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.335" end="01:06:06.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My money came with my eyes</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.135" end="01:06:10.135" style="s2">and my eyes have seen enough.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.035" end="01:06:10.135" style="s2">I do not buy stolen houses.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.635" end="01:06:25.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That paper is a certified copy. This</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.135" end="01:06:27.335" style="s2">girl stole the original from our archive</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.435" end="01:06:28.535" style="s2">and the police have the case.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.335" end="01:06:30.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told the police I stole the</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.535" end="01:06:32.635" style="s2">original, Mr. Okon, in front of every</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.935" end="01:06:34.035" style="s2">staff member.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.635" end="01:06:36.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the camera showed you opening the</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.035" end="01:06:38.835" style="s2">box.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.135" end="01:06:41.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Opening it, yes. Then putting every page</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.835" end="01:06:41.235" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.935" end="01:06:49.535" style="s2">So I will ask you one thing in front of</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.635" end="01:06:49.535" style="s2">the inspector. Open your briefcase.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.235" end="01:06:55.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are confidential bank papers, not</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.535" end="01:06:55.335" style="s2">for a suspect.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.335" end="01:07:03.135" style="s2">Then open it for me, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.335" end="01:07:04.935" style="s2">On Thursday, I was told a document was</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.135" end="01:07:07.435" style="s2">stolen. Yesterday, I was told where to</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.935" end="01:07:07.435" style="s2">find it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.635" end="01:07:13.935" style="s2">Inspector, you know who I am.</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.535" end="01:07:16.235" style="s2">That is why I am asking politely. Open</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.935" end="01:07:16.235" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.035" end="01:07:28.336" style="s2">Original and a note.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.536" end="01:07:28.336" style="s2">Hold until Saturday 4:00 o&#39;clock.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.336" end="01:07:36.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That paper MEANS NOTHING.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.736" end="01:07:36.936" style="s2">SOMEBODY PUT IT THERE.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.936" end="01:07:43.336" style="s2">Tomorrow morning Okon calls the police.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.436" end="01:07:45.736" style="s2">The girl stole the original from their</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.336" end="01:07:47.536" style="s2">archive. He has her on camera.</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.736" end="01:07:49.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stole it?</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.536" end="01:07:51.936" style="s2">That girl is too proud to steal a</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.436" end="01:07:51.936" style="s2">biscuit.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.936" end="01:07:57.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The camera says she opened the box.</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.636" end="01:08:00.636" style="s2">The part where she put everything back</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.436" end="01:08:00.636" style="s2">Okon lost this morning.</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.036" end="01:08:04.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then by Saturday she is sleeping in a</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.936" end="01:08:05.936" style="s2">cell.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.036" end="01:08:07.736" style="s2">And who listens to a thief who says her</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.936" end="01:08:10.536" style="s2">uncle is a liar?</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.736" end="01:08:10.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.836" end="01:08:17.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, I am not going to Ogbomoso. I</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.336" end="01:08:17.536" style="s2">will not keep quiet for you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.036" end="01:08:26.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ademola Capital stands this sale. Only</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.336" end="01:08:29.536" style="s2">the chairman can overrule me and the</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.336" end="01:08:29.536" style="s2">chairman is in Abuja.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.036" end="01:08:38.436" style="s2">I came back on Thursday night.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.636" end="01:08:41.136" style="s2">Clerk, this is not your business. Go and</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.436" end="01:08:41.136" style="s2">wait by the car.</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.136" end="01:08:49.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okon,</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.336" end="01:08:50.836" style="s2">I told my girl I would report you to the</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.636" end="01:08:53.636" style="s2">chairman.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.836" end="01:08:53.636" style="s2">Here he is.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.836" end="01:08:56.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.336" end="01:09:05.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Vice Chancellor called that man to</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.136" end="01:09:05.736" style="s2">the stage, Mr. Kayode Ademola.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.536" end="01:09:15.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.836" end="01:09:15.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, two months and you said tea.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.636" end="01:09:20.336" style="s2">Two months I made your tea and read your</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.436" end="01:09:22.536" style="s2">files.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.336" end="01:09:25.936" style="s2">In August, 5 million naira from Jide</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.536" end="01:09:27.637" style="s2">Motors went into your wife&#39;s account.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.936" end="01:09:28.938" style="s2">Explain it to the inspector. You are</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.637" end="01:09:30.938" style="s2">dismissed.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.938" end="01:09:33.938" style="s2">Put your lanyard on the table</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.938" end="01:09:33.938" style="s2">the way you cut hers.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.137" end="01:09:42.838" style="s2">Exhibit, inspector.</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.038" end="01:09:42.838" style="s2">than it looks.</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.938" end="01:09:49.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.637" end="01:09:57.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On Monday, a trainee wrote to me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.637" end="01:09:58.938" style="s2">She asked me to put her certificate in</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.038" end="01:10:01.538" style="s2">her hand.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.938" end="01:10:04.938" style="s2">I promised before the whole house on the</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.538" end="01:10:04.938" style="s2">day it matters most.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.838" end="01:10:08.738" style="s2">This is the house.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.938" end="01:10:19.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, you told me to forget my</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.738" end="01:10:21.338" style="s2">certificate.</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.238" end="01:10:23.738" style="s2">I did not.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.338" end="01:10:25.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then by her father&#39;s will, from this</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.738" end="01:10:28.438" style="s2">day, this house belongs to Tolani</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.938" end="01:10:28.438" style="s2">Bakare.</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.938" end="01:10:35.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ademola, please. You told me my file</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.438" end="01:10:36.838" style="s2">would wait.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.238" end="01:10:39.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked me to keep your file quiet,</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.838" end="01:10:42.938" style="s2">sir. I kept it quiet long enough.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.938" end="01:10:44.538" style="s2">60 million naira by Friday the 31st</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.938" end="01:10:46.738" style="s2">or the company takes your house in Lekki</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.538" end="01:10:48.137" style="s2">and every car in your yard.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.738" end="01:10:50.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.137" end="01:10:52.838" style="s2">you cannot do that to us. We are family</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.338" end="01:10:52.838" style="s2">to her.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.637" end="01:10:56.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie,</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.838" end="01:10:59.438" style="s2">you said a gown does not wash plates.</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.838" end="01:11:01.538" style="s2">You were right. It was never for plates.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.438" end="01:11:02.738" style="s2">It was for this.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.538" end="01:11:05.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani,</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.738" end="01:11:07.538" style="s2">this house is big. There is room.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.538" end="01:11:10.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There was room for seven years, uncle,</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.538" end="01:11:10.838" style="s2">and you kept me in the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.938" end="01:11:14.538" style="s2">This is my father&#39;s house. The band can</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.338" end="01:11:17.637" style="s2">stay.</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.538" end="01:11:17.637" style="s2">You too cannot.</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.738" end="01:11:32.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jide Bakare, I am arresting you for</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.439" end="01:11:34.339" style="s2">forgery of a legal document and for</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.639" end="01:11:35.839" style="s2">using it to sell a house that is not</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.339" end="01:11:38.439" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.839" end="01:11:38.439" style="s2">Your hands, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.139" end="01:11:47.339" style="s2">And you, Mr. Okon,</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.639" end="01:11:50.339" style="s2">for a false report to the police and for</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.339" end="01:11:53.539" style="s2">fraud against your own company.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.339" end="01:11:53.539" style="s2">You will ride in the same car.</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.639" end="01:11:59.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inspector, I have a family.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.039" end="01:11:59.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So did the girl you sent to my cell.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.239" end="01:12:05.939" style="s2">Madam, on Thursday I put these same</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.339" end="01:12:07.039" style="s2">handcuffs on you in front of your</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.939" end="01:12:09.339" style="s2">colleagues.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.039" end="01:12:11.339" style="s2">The case against you is closed.</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.339" end="01:12:12.839" style="s2">I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.339" end="01:12:14.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, inspector. Please say it</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.839" end="01:12:17.239" style="s2">again on Monday in the banking hall</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.739" end="01:12:20.139" style="s2">where they all saw.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.239" end="01:12:20.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will be there at 9:00.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.239" end="01:12:24.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani,</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.539" end="01:12:25.839" style="s2">my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.039" end="01:12:29.439" style="s2">I am your father&#39;s brother.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.839" end="01:12:31.539" style="s2">I fed you. Seven years I fed you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.439" end="01:12:33.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You fed me, uncle.</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.539" end="01:12:35.539" style="s2">Then you sold me on a road to pay for</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.039" end="01:12:35.539" style="s2">the food.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.239" end="01:12:41.839" style="s2">I will not curse you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.439" end="01:12:41.839" style="s2">I will not visit you either.</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.039" end="01:12:54.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bimpe, get your things. We are going</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.539" end="01:12:54.739" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.739" end="01:12:59.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which home, mommy? If daddy cannot pay</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.839" end="01:13:02.039" style="s2">by Friday, the Lekki house goes to the</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.639" end="01:13:02.039" style="s2">bank.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.739" end="01:13:07.539" style="s2">And I am not living with you. I am</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.739" end="01:13:11.239" style="s2">staying with my cousin.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.539" end="01:13:11.239" style="s2">After everything I gave you,</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.339" end="01:13:17.739" style="s2">you gave me fear, mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.539" end="01:13:17.739" style="s2">She gave me my JAMB form.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.139" end="01:13:27.339" style="s2">You told me receipts do not come back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.639" end="01:13:27.339" style="s2">Neither will you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.640" end="01:13:48.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most of you knew me as the clerk who</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.340" end="01:13:51.240" style="s2">made bad tea.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.840" end="01:13:53.840" style="s2">Some of you laughed at the tea</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.240" end="01:13:56.740" style="s2">and you were right to.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.840" end="01:13:59.340" style="s2">Last Thursday in this hall</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.740" end="01:14:01.640" style="s2">this company called a woman a thief</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.340" end="01:14:03.240" style="s2">caught her lanyard and watched her leave</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.640" end="01:14:07.240" style="s2">in handcuffs.</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.240" end="01:14:10.340" style="s2">Ademola Capital owes her an apology</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.240" end="01:14:10.340" style="s2">and I owe her too.</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.540" end="01:14:17.140" style="s2">In her first week in recovery before she</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.740" end="01:14:19.340" style="s2">was ever sent to the basement she found</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.140" end="01:14:21.940" style="s2">11 loans marked settled with no money</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.340" end="01:14:21.940" style="s2">behind them.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.640" end="01:14:36.640" style="s2">It took me six weeks to find what she</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.440" end="01:14:36.640" style="s2">found in two days.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.140" end="01:14:42.240" style="s2">When the examiners in Abuja asked me on</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.040" end="01:14:44.540" style="s2">Thursday who found them I gave them her</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.240" end="01:14:44.540" style="s2">name.</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.640" end="01:14:54.540" style="s2">From today Miss Bakare leads the review</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.740" end="01:14:56.440" style="s2">of those 11 loans full salary from her</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.540" end="01:14:58.140" style="s2">first day in this building.</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.440" end="01:15:01.440" style="s2">She earned every naira of it before</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.140" end="01:15:01.440" style="s2">anybody here knew her name.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.640" end="01:15:07.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Twice I refused money sir because nobody</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.240" end="01:15:09.040" style="s2">gives a debtor&#39;s daughter anything for</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.540" end="01:15:11.940" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.040" end="01:15:13.040" style="s2">This one I earned I will take it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.940" end="01:15:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chuks</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.040" end="01:15:18.140" style="s2">you drove my mother you carried bags up</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.440" end="01:15:21.140" style="s2">my stairs and you never once laughed</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.140" end="01:15:21.140" style="s2">when I said I was a clerk.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.440" end="01:15:26.340" style="s2">I laughed sir in the car.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.540" end="01:15:27.640" style="s2">From today you head the chairman&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.340" end="01:15:30.940" style="s2">office.</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.640" end="01:15:30.940" style="s2">Try to laugh more quietly.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.742" end="01:15:54.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin, I am taking the room with the</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.742" end="01:15:56.942" style="s2">window mango tree. You can fight me</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.442" end="01:15:56.942" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.942" end="01:16:01.942" style="s2">Take it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.142" end="01:16:03.842" style="s2">Just do not paint it yellow.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.942" end="01:16:06.242" style="s2">Too late. In my head, it is already</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.842" end="01:16:06.242" style="s2">yellow.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.042" end="01:16:16.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tolani, let me say this once properly.</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.042" end="01:16:20.742" style="s2">On the Lagoon Road, I let you think I</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.742" end="01:16:22.342" style="s2">was a clerk.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.742" end="01:16:24.842" style="s2">I let you pour my tea and worry about my</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.342" end="01:16:24.842" style="s2">salary.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.542" end="01:16:30.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I worried a lot about your salary.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.942" end="01:16:31.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept your certificate in a drawer</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.342" end="01:16:33.542" style="s2">while you walked to the university to</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.742" end="01:16:35.242" style="s2">ask for it.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.542" end="01:16:38.642" style="s2">I read your letter twice before I</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.242" end="01:16:38.642" style="s2">answered it as a stranger.</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.042" end="01:16:48.442" style="s2">I saw the copy of that consent weeks</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.842" end="01:16:48.442" style="s2">before you did, and I said nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.842" end="01:16:53.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I found out in front of 50 guests</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.942" end="01:16:53.642" style="s2">and a band.</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.542" end="01:17:01.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did. I had reasons, and every one of</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.842" end="01:17:03.842" style="s2">them sounded wise in my study.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.042" end="01:17:05.942" style="s2">None of them sounds wise in this room.</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.842" end="01:17:08.342" style="s2">I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.942" end="01:17:10.042" style="s2">Not as a chairman.</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.342" end="01:17:12.742" style="s2">As the man who stood who stood behind</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.042" end="01:17:12.742" style="s2">you on that lawn.</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.942" end="01:17:18.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then here is my condition.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.642" end="01:17:20.442" style="s2">No more lanyards.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.142" end="01:17:22.542" style="s2">No more draws.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.442" end="01:17:24.242" style="s2">And if you ever want to marry me,</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.542" end="01:17:25.942" style="s2">you ask me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.242" end="01:17:29.242" style="s2">Not my uncle.</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.942" end="01:17:32.142" style="s2">Not on a road beside my graduation.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.242" end="01:17:34.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will ask you. Only you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.142" end="01:17:37.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if he forgets my daughter, I will</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.242" end="01:17:37.643" style="s2">report him to the chairman.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.543" end="01:17:45.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, you know the chairman now.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.843" end="01:17:45.343" style="s2">That is why he will listen.</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.543" end="01:17:57.243" style="s2">Papa,</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.543" end="01:17:57.243" style="s2">I am home.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.443" end="01:18:16.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies and gentlemen,</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.343" end="01:18:18.943" style="s2">three weeks ago I called a name in this</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.343" end="01:18:21.143" style="s2">university and nobody stood.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.943" end="01:18:23.243" style="s2">Tonight I will call it again. The</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.143" end="01:18:26.443" style="s2">Ademola Prize for the best graduating</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.243" end="01:18:26.443" style="s2">student in accounting.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.243" end="01:18:41.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on my dear, walk first.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.243" end="01:19:03.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your aunt pulled this off your head on</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.643" end="01:19:05.343" style="s2">the lawn.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.343" end="01:19:09.343" style="s2">I picked it up that same morning and I</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.343" end="01:19:12.543" style="s2">have kept it in my drawer ever since.</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.343" end="01:19:14.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The drawer again.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.543" end="01:19:16.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last thing in it, the drawer is</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.143" end="01:19:16.743" style="s2">empty now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.143" end="01:19:22.543" style="s2">Tolani Bakare,</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.843" end="01:19:24.043" style="s2">nobody gives you to me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.543" end="01:19:27.543" style="s2">Not a debt,</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.043" end="01:19:29.443" style="s2">not an uncle, not a file.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.543" end="01:19:31.243" style="s2">So I am asking you</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.443" end="01:19:33.043" style="s2">in front of your teachers and your</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.243" end="01:19:35.043" style="s2">family,</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.043" end="01:19:36.543" style="s2">will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.043" end="01:19:40.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked me,</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.543" end="01:19:40.344" style="s2">not my uncle, You asked me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.545" end="01:19:55.545" style="s2">Papa was right.</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.744" end="01:19:55.545" style="s2">Nobody can repossess what you learned.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
